1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,184
Hey everyone, welcome back to Car Service
Podcast.

2
00:00:03,534 --> 00:00:06,822
I'm Sam, and today we're talking head
gasket repair.

3
00:00:07,172 --> 00:00:11,516
Our guest, Dmitry, had a pre‑purchase
check that turned into a full repair.

4
00:00:11,866 --> 00:00:16,786
Yeah, I was eyeing a used BMW and wanted a
clean bill of health.

5
00:00:17,135 --> 00:00:20,759
Smart move — pre‑purchase inspections can
save you big time.

6
00:00:21,109 --> 00:00:25,285
The inspection at Golden Horse flagged a
leaking head gasket.

7
00:00:25,635 --> 00:00:27,795
Leaking? That sounds serious.

8
00:00:28,145 --> 00:00:32,993
It was. Coolant mixing with oil, the
classic sign.

9
00:00:33,343 --> 00:00:35,023
Did you book the repair right there?

10
00:00:35,373 --> 00:00:40,101
I booked online at golden‑horse.ae, got a
slot next morning.

11
00:00:40,451 --> 00:00:43,307
Nice, the Al Quoz workshop is easy to
find.

12
00:00:43,657 --> 00:00:48,145
Warehouse 4 on 22nd Street, clean and
organized.

13
00:00:48,494 --> 00:00:50,294
How did the team explain the work?

14
00:00:50,644 --> 00:00:55,444
They walked me through the diagnosis,
showed the pressure test results.

15
00:00:55,794 --> 00:00:57,138
Transparency matters.

16
00:00:57,488 --> 00:01:04,784
Absolutely. No hidden fees, they quoted
1200 AED upfront.

17
00:01:05,134 --> 00:01:06,886
That's the price from their page.

18
00:01:07,236 --> 00:01:08,700
How long did the repair take?

19
00:01:09,050 --> 00:01:12,962
About a day, they kept me updated via
WhatsApp.

20
00:01:13,312 --> 00:01:15,328
A day is quick for a head gasket.

21
00:01:15,677 --> 00:01:19,781
Car runs smooth now, no more overheating.

22
00:01:20,131 --> 00:01:21,451
Feels like a new engine.

23
00:01:21,801 --> 00:01:24,969
Exactly. Worth every dirham.

24
00:01:25,319 --> 00:01:27,479
Great story, thanks for sharing.

25
00:01:27,829 --> 00:01:30,037
Now, Omar with a quick brake tip.

26
00:01:30,387 --> 00:01:35,571
Sure. Golden Horse offers brake repair,
and regular checks catch wear early.

27
00:01:35,921 --> 00:01:38,249
So listen for squeaks or a soft pedal.

28
00:01:38,599 --> 00:01:41,311
Exactly, those are common early signs.

29
00:01:41,660 --> 00:01:42,860
Myth busting time.

30
00:01:43,210 --> 00:01:46,498
Myth: head gasket repairs always cost a
fortune.

31
00:01:46,848 --> 00:01:50,784
Fact: Golden Horse starts at 1200 AED.

32
00:01:51,134 --> 00:01:53,198
Much more affordable than people think.

33
00:01:53,548 --> 00:01:54,460
Thanks for listening.

34
00:01:54,810 --> 00:01:58,578
Book your service at golden‑horse.ae,
Dubai Al Quoz 3.

35
00:01:58,928 --> 00:02:00,176
See you next episode.
